<title>SPAIN: Spain's Bodegas Riojanas to float 35 pct in IPO.</title>
<headline>Spain's Bodegas Riojanas to float 35 pct in IPO.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish winery Bodegas Riojanas will float 35 percent of its share capital in an initial public offering, the CNMV stock market commission said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The company will reduce the nominal share price to 100 pesetas from 500 pesetas and will raise the number of shares in circulation to 5,440,000 from 1,088,000. Of those, 1,904,000 shares will be sold in the IPO.</p>
<p>Lead managers are Banco Popular and Popular Rabobank S.A.. The underwriter is Asegurador Popular Rabobank S.A.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585-2160</p>
</text>
